    "input_tokens": 3657,
    "output_tokens": 142
   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 3,
   "response_text": "The logs show successful training with validation accuracy around 0.96, which matches the metrics but is clearly anomalous. Let me examine the training code to understand what might be causing this overfitting or data issue:",
   "tool_calls": [
    {
     "id": "toolu_01FevaDb9RPNVXc8RAydtZZu",
